# Claude Code artifacts — IDE-specific tooling, kept out of the repo
# so contributors aren't asked to pick up another contributor's local
# AI-tool configuration. CLAUDE.md is also covered by Marcel's global
# git-ignore but listed here explicitly so a clone on any machine
# without that global rule still keeps the file out.
CLAUDE.md
.claude/
.claude/**

# Same for other AI / IDE assistant artifacts.
.cursor/
.cursorrules
.aider*
.github/copilot-instructions.md
AGENTS.md
GEMINI.md
